observed = "Catchup skips old entries but accepts any larger entry.Version without requiring the next version. It sends one asynchronous changeset per retained tree, whose worker increments that tree once, then assigns the arbitrary entry.Version to lastCommitInfo. A WAL jump from H to H+2 can expose global height H+2 with tree height H+1 and missing mutations; OpenDB only logs index drift on normal startup."
