observed = "After acquiring fileLock, OpenDB returns directly on removeTmpDirs, snapshot loading, WAL opening, catchup or drift-refusal errors. Once acquired, the file lock, loaded mmap trees and opened WAL have no deferred rollback cleanup on those paths, so a failed open can retain resources and prevent a retry in the same process."
